BT 1 0 0 1 0 351.804 Tm .321882 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: The clean bill makes a prima facie case of carrier fault for the shortage and deterioration, and) Tj T* 0 Tw .67125 Tw (the printed clause exempting the carrier from all liability is void so the carrier answers unless it) Tj T* 0 Tw (proves an excepted cause with extraordinary care.) Tj  T* 2.101412 Tw (Under Art. 350 of the Code of Commerce, the bill of lading admits receipt of the goods as) Tj T* 0 Tw .460286 Tw (described and embodies the voyage terms, and a clean bill acknowledges apparent good order at) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.1085 Tw (loading. Under Art. 1735 of the Civil Code, good order receipt followed by short or bad order) Tj T* 0 Tw .898 Tw (delivery raises prima facie carrier fault. Under Westwind Shipping v. UCPB General Insurance) Tj T* 0 Tw 4.602 Tw (\(G.R. No. 200289, 2013\), that sequence lays the prima facie case on the carrier with) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.59 Tw (reimbursement against the actual wrongdoer preserved. Under Art. 1745 of the Civil Code,) Tj T* 0 Tw .73 Tw (stipulations that erase carrier responsibility or cut diligence below extraordinary fall as contrary) Tj T* 0 Tw (to public policy.) Tj  T* 3.2752 Tw (Here, the carrier issued a clean bill for bagged fertilizer in apparent good order, and the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.871 Tw (consignee received short and hardened bags at discharge, which completes the prima facie) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.289429 Tw (sequence. The printed total exemption asks less than the diligence the law commands, so it) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.588 Tw (contributes nothing to the defense although the shipper accepted the adhesion bill. Reading) Tj T* 0 Tw .863143 Tw (acceptance of a preprinted bill as consent to total exemption would enforce the very stipulation) Tj T* 0 Tw (Art. 1745 voids.) Tj  T* 2.532857 Tw (The carrier therefore answers for the shortage and deterioration unless it proves one of the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.317714 Tw (excepted causes with extraordinary care, with the clean bill fixing the case the carrier must) Tj T* 0 Tw (defeat.) Tj T* ET
