BT 1 0 0 1 0 369.804 Tm .936 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: \(a\) Yes, the carrier is presumed at fault upon death or injury of a passenger. \(b\) It owes the) Tj T* 0 Tw .0512 Tw (utmost diligence of very cautious persons with due regard for all the circumstances. \(c\) The same) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.644 Tw (test governs a fellow-passenger stabbing, since liability turns on what diligence could have) Tj T* 0 Tw (prevented.) Tj  T* .301333 Tw (Under Art. 1756 of the Civil Code, death of or injury to a passenger presumes the carrier at fault) Tj T* 0 Tw .4728 Tw (unless it proves the extraordinary diligence of Arts. 1733 and 1755. Under Art. 1755, the carrier) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.4512 Tw (must carry passengers safely as far as human care and foresight can provide using the utmost) Tj T* 0 Tw .27 Tw (diligence of very cautious persons. Under Art. 1759, the carrier answers for assaults by strangers) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.619 Tw (and fellow passengers only where good-family diligence could have prevented or stopped the) Tj T* 0 Tw .218118 Tw (attack, so it is no absolute insurer. In LRTA v. Navidad \(G.R. No. 145804, 2003\), the Court held) Tj T* 0 Tw (the safety duty non-delegable and measured it by utmost diligence.) Tj  T* .36075 Tw (Here, Ysidro was a paying passenger of Yatco aboard Bus No. 904 from Munoz, Nueva Ecija to) Tj T* 0 Tw .1192 Tw (Manila when the bus stopped in traffic before the Gerona, Tarlac market. The driver had alighted) Tj T* 0 Tw .714 Tw (to check tires and relieve himself when an unidentified man hurled a huge rock through the left) Tj T* 0 Tw .6288 Tw (window and struck Ysidro between the eyes, and the crew drove him toward the hospital where) Tj T* 0 Tw .6504 Tw (he expired on the way. The presumption therefore applies on every limb, and Yatco must prove) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.237231 Tw (precautions rather than point to sound tires or to the stranger hand. The fellow-passenger) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.3624 Tw (stabbing is judged the same way, since the carrier answers only where its crew could have) Tj T* 0 Tw (prevented or stopped the assault.) Tj  T* 1.4056 Tw (Yatco therefore carries the burden on all three limbs and escapes only by proving that utmost) Tj T* 0 Tw (diligence could neither have foreseen nor stopped the fatal attack.) Tj T* ET
