BT 1 0 0 1 0 333.804 Tm .828706 Tw 18 TL /F2 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (A: The line pays for the pocketed watch as of course, while the rock blinding turns on whether) Tj T* 0 Tw (good-family crew vigilance could have prevented or stopped the attack.) Tj  T* .926824 Tw (Under Art. 1759 of the Civil Code, the carrier answers for the negligence and wilful acts of its) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.16 Tw (employees though they acted beyond scope or against orders, and diligence in selection and) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.617846 Tw (supervision is no defense. Under Art. 1760 of the Civil Code, that employee responsibility) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.0016 Tw (cannot be eliminated or limited by stipulation or ticket statement. Under Art. 1763 of the Civil) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.444 Tw (Code, the carrier answers for injuries from fellow passengers or strangers only where its) Tj T* 0 Tw .006 Tw (employees through the diligence of a good father of a family could have prevented or stopped the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.0712 Tw (act. Under LRTA v. Navidad \(G.R. No. 145804, 2003\), the safety duty behind these articles is) Tj T* 0 Tw (non-delegable from fare payment with entry.) Tj  T* 1.293429 Tw (Here, a conductor pocketed a sleeping passenger watch, which is a wilful employee act inside) Tj T* 0 Tw .542 Tw (Art. 1759 though done against orders, so no hiring care or ticket term escapes it. A stranger at a) Tj T* 0 Tw .6728 Tw (traffic stop hurled a rock through the window and blinded another rider, which is stranger harm) Tj T* 0 Tw .673714 Tw (inside Art. 1763 where closed windows and guards and route care decide the outcome. Reading) Tj T* 0 Tw .028 Tw (the theft as outside scope mistakes the very channel Art. 1759 closes, while reading every thrown) Tj T* 0 Tw (rock as automatic liability mistakes preventability for insurance.) Tj  T* 1.411714 Tw (Theft therefore pays as of course with no diligence defense available, while the blinding pays) Tj T* 0 Tw .084706 Tw (only where the prevention proof fails, so the line answers for the watch and reaches the merits on) Tj T* 0 Tw (the rock.) Tj T* ET
