BT 1 0 0 1 0 351.888 Tm .18525 Tw 18 TL /F4 12 Tf .066667 .066667 .066667 rg (2018 Bar Q: Ysidro, a paying passenger, was on board Bus No. 904 owned and operated by ) Tj T* 0 Tw .835 Tw (Yatco Transportation Company \(Yatco\). He boarded the bus at Munoz, Nueva Ecija with ) Tj T* 0 Tw .451059 Tw (Manila as his final destination. He was seated on the first row, window seat on the left side ) Tj T* 0 Tw .194824 Tw (of the bus. As the bus was negotiating the national highway in front of the public market of ) Tj T* 0 Tw .020667 Tw (Gerona, Tarlac, the bus came to a full stop because of the traffic. The driver of the bus took ) Tj T* 0 Tw .509647 Tw (this opportunity to check on the tires of the bus and to relieve himself. As he was alighting ) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.2408 Tw (from the bus to do these, an unidentified man standing along the highway hurled a huge ) Tj T* 0 Tw .940941 Tw (rock at the left side of the bus and hit Ysidro between his eyes. He lost consciousness and ) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.383714 Tw (immediately the driver, with the conductor, drove the bus to bring him to the nearest ) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.767692 Tw (hospital. He expired before the bus could reach the hospital. Ysidro's wife and children ) Tj T* 0 Tw .6488 Tw (brought a civil action to collect damages from Yatco, alleging that as a common carrier, it ) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.587 Tw (was required to exercise extraordinary diligence in ensuring the safety of its passengers. ) Tj T* 0 Tw .9165 Tw (They contended that, in case of injuries and/or death on the part of any of its passengers, ) Tj T* 0 Tw .262 Tw (the common carrier is presumed to be at fault. In its defense, Yatco alleged that it is not an ) Tj T* 0 Tw .708 Tw (absolute insurer of its passengers and that Ysidro's death was not due to any defect in the ) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.977846 Tw (means of transport or method of transporting passengers, or the negligent acts of its ) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.3376 Tw (employees. Since the accident was due to the fault of a stranger over whom the common ) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.313882 Tw (carrier had no control, or of which it did not have any prior knowledge to be able to ) Tj T* 0 Tw .7112 Tw (prevent it, the cause of Ysidro's death should be considered a fortuitous event and not the ) Tj T* 0 Tw .628 Tw (liability of the common carrier. \(a\) Is a common carrier presumed to be at fault whenever) Tj T* 0 Tw ET
